WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.980
Episode 9    My Big Sister Has Changed

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:35.990
It's been a while, huh?

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:37.990
Urami?

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.640
Yeah.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.690
Hey, Big Sister...

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:44.660
Yeah?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:51.040
<b>Menacing</b>

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.660
Who is that?

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:56.870
Kii!

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.030
<b>Clueless</b>

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:58.520
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.770
K-Kii?!

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.110
Kii-ii-ii!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.410
Just someone I know!

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.870
What is your name?

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:18.660
Fu—

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.680
<b>Flustered</b>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.010
M-Mudo, sir.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.160
Mudo-kun?

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.850
What's an average Gekko foot soldier 
doin' in my daughter's...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.200
in <i>Reaper Princess</i>'s room?

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:31.880
Well...

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.040
H-He was helping me study!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.670
I have a test coming up!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.920
You great oaf!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.160
What's a great soldier of 
Gekko need to be studyin' for?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.560
All ya need's a wicked heart and 
a drive toward world domination!

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.680
And what's happenin' in this room, here?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.180
Look at all this froo-froo crap!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.060
You're not even puttin' up a Gekko flag!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:59.820
<b>Lifetime Gekko Soldier</b>

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.150
Hey! Stop it, Dad!

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.180
You're ruinin' the atmosphere!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.570
Don't you talk that way to—

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:02.820
Ouch!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.580
<b><i>Shock</i></b>

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:07.010
A-Are these... Super Bosslar-kun Dolls?!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:13.330
The legendary dolls that I longed for so 
desperately when I was still in action...

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.340
Just left lyin' around...

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.590
There's just nowhere to put them.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:21.610
Bosslar-sama! I beg your forgiveness!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:21.610
Sorry. This is just kind 
of how my father is...

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:23.180
Don't worry. It's no problem.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.130
And I have to say, your father is very—

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:26.130
Oh, right!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.600
Listen up, Desumi!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.980
I heard you turned down 
your monster promotion!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.970
I spent my entire life as a 
low-level Gekko soldier...

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.730
I can't tell ya how proud 
I was seein' my daughter

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.860
rising through the ranks so quickly...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.370
What's goin' through your head 
turnin' that down, you great oaf?

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.620
If you don't mind my saying so, sir.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:53.800
Desumi-san only reached that decision 
after long, hard consideration.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.170
I ask that you do not chastise her for—

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.760
<b><i>Smash</i></b>

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.440
F-Mudo!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:22.440
What would you know about my sister?

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:26.820
Maybe you oughta stay outta 
our business, outsider.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.960
A-Are you all right, Fudo?

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.470
Well, she's definitely your little sister...

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.330
Full of terrifying potential.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:37.100
I appreciate the sentiment, Fudo.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.930
But you really shouldn't speak 
up about my life like that.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.340
Urami is...

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.860
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.860
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:49.350
<i>I love my big sister. I love my 
big sister. I love my big sister.</i>

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.490
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.490
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:46.000
Let's just say she's got 
a serious sister complex.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.110
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.110
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.660
I see. I'll be careful.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.740
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.740
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.350
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.350
<b>Love Big Sister</b>

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.260
<i>Here's the best way to blast away fatigue!</i>

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:56.710
<i>The brand-new energy drink, Power 1!</i>

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.220
<i>Red Gelato recommends Power 1!</i>

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.720
<i>With just one drink, you can 
blast away Gekko <i>and</i> exhaustion!</i>

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.460
You annoyin' little brat!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:09.580
Reaper Princess is gonna tear 
out your guts any day now!

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:14.910
What? Why?!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.580
Just kidding!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.920
Your humor is adorable.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.800
We gotta get rid of Gelato 5
 as soon as possible!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.320
Desumi! Quit wastin' your time on studies!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.430
Spend it trainin' from now on instead!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.800
In a year's time, you'll be 
finished with high school,

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.590
and you'll be able to 
focus on Gekko full-time!

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:41.690
You got that, Desumi?

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.830
Yes.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:51.410
I hope we can go together, Fudo.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.250
I know we will.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.960
S-Sir!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.650
I have a request to make of you!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:02.730
Yeah?

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:07.180
Desumi-san wishes to go to college.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:08.790
I beg you, allow her!

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:16.290
<i>Fudo...</i>

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.600
I thought somethin' strange 
was goin' on here.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:24.060
The sister I knew wasn't 
all carefree like this.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:28.240
She should be the strongest 
and most ruthless person ever.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.070
And you ruined her.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.240
My sister was invincible.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.490
Give her back!

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:40.830
Stop, Urami.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.580
Let me go.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.150
Stop it.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.840
Tearful...

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.430
I hate you, Big Sister!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:04.070
Sir! I beg you, give Desumi-san 
permission to go to university!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.370
This is a family matter, son.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.940
You'd better stay out of it.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.210
I will not be silent!

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:16.220
All right.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.310
You give me no choice!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.680
Get up.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:23.080
<b>Menacing</b>

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:23.080
<b>Menacing</b>

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:23.080
I'll teach you a lesson in the 
Gekko way of doin' things.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:24.540
Sir!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.090
Let us begin, Mudo-kun!

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.610
W-Wait a mi—

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:32.300
Kii!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.660
I didn't do any—

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.370
Do you see, Mudo-kun?

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.750
This is the art of defeat.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.070
Art?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.480
"How spectacularly can one lose a fight?"

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:54.320
I spent my years with this organization 
working to refine this one skill!

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.340
But I don't think you understand 
the pride I take in it.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:00.440
I do.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.930
Mudo-kun...

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.970
You truly understand?

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.610
Yes.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.010
Gleek!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.020
<b>Gleek</b>

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.480
<b>No Artistry</b>

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.020
Gwah!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.720
<b>Gwaaaaah!</b>

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.720
<b>Artistry</b>

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.470
Others have laughed at that skill.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.480
But I always believed it was 
worth devoting myself to.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.130
I will not be silent!

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:30.610
I can tell that you, too, are prepared 
to devote yourself to a single cause.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.330
You seem like a young man 
with a lot of promise.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.150
Desumi. I'm borrowin' your shower.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.380
S-Sure...

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:57.260
We can discuss the university 
thing another time.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.570
See ya later, Desumi.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.380
Look after Urami tomorrow, would ya?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.780
I'm sorry about all that, Fudo.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:23.380
I got you mixed up in a 
complicated situation.

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:27.420
Easily dealt with, if it means 
we can go to university together.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.900
You really are very dashing.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.650
Fudo, thank you for everything.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.370
Of course!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.290
<i>What's she lookin' like that for?</i>

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.270
<i>I don't wanna see her lookin' like that!</i>

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:09.340
<i>I'll never accept that 
man's presence in her life!</i>

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.970
Love After World Domination!

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:21.800
<b>Five
Years
 Ago</b>

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.650
Hey, hey! Wait up, Urami!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:21.800
What's the matter, Urami?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.570
Look at her! Urami the Loner!

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.010
C'mon, tell us off!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.140
Bet she can't!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.020
She's just a little emo who can't 
talk louder than a mumble!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.290
Desumi!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.030
Crap! Beat it, guys!

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:45.540
<b>Candy Shop</b>

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:45.540
<b>Chikugo</b>

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.810
Don't cry, Urami.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.970
Here. Want an ice pop?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:57.670
<b>Candy Shop</b>

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:57.670
<b>Chikugo</b>

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.510
Get strong, Urami.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:05.310
Strength is what you need to survive.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:06.870
Right.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:26.700
<b>Present
 Day</b>

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:26.700
<b>To Mt. Takao Entrance</b>

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.330
<b>Yesterday was great!
I loved your room!</b>

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.460
<b>Bring it on,</b>

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.460
<b>any time!</b>

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.320
<b>Grr</b>

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:39.690
Grr...

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:54.490
What's with you? It's like ya 
been in a bad mood all morning.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.320
I ain't in no bad mood.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.690
Hey, you sure this's where you wanna go?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:04.070
I don't think it's worth sendin' Dad 
home early and stickin' around for.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.030
What's the big deal?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.700
I just want to check out the place 
I'm gonna start workin' next year.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:28.820
Salute Reaper Princess!

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.100
Welcome, Reaper Princess!

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.850
That's my big sister!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.850
<i>When she's outside she 
acts all weak an' casual,</i>

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.860
<i>but inside the organization's walls,
 she's totally intimidatin'!</i>

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.550
What do I always tell you?

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:46.490
I really don't like getting 
the full royal treatment...

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.350
Just say "hello there," okay?

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.460
I'm not sure we can really...

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:52.500
Big Sister...

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:56.170
More importantly, do I look
 any different today?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.090
Well...

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:01.000
Oh, perhaps you seem a bit more 
bloodthirsty than usual!

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.790
C'mon, notice the new hair!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.880
Come over here.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.990
Is that how you always act in 
front of your subordinates?

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.450
I guess so, more or less...

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.850
Pathetic.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.420
What's got you in such a bad mood?

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:33.620
Reaper Princess's little sister, eh?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.250
Y-Yes. I'll be out of 
junior high next year.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.630
I hope to join Gekko then!

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:44.400
I fear Reaper Princess has 
set the bar very high.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.760
I hope you'll work hard to vault it!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.510
Y-Yes! I will!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.800
If you're related to Reaper Princess,

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.780
you must be pretty talented.

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:56.520
Gekko will be fortunate to have you.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.930
<i>Even the rest of the Princess 
series respect her.</i>

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:01.100
<i>My big sister really is—</i>

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.260
Urami! You like popcorn?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.640
I hear a new place just 
opened up in Harajuku!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.380
Let's go!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.640
Wait!

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.280
Big Sister—

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:14.050
I wanna try it out before I eat 
it with Fudo—I mean, Mudo.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:17.290
And who wants to hang around 
this musty old place?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.790
<b>Speechless</b>

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.750
I apologize for my sister! 
I apologize for my sister!

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:27.300
<b>That's
pretty
typical,
 actually</b>

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:47.330
Here, it's frozen popcorn!

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.050
No, thank you.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.830
It looks great on you, Urami!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.080
Seriously, no thank you.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.780
I'll take it!

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.800
Thank you!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.340
I wonder if he'd like this outfit!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.590
Mudo has one of these!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:16.180
And he says this one's really convenient!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.850
Oh, this one too!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
<b>Caramellato</b>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
<b>\hStrawberry
Banana Cream</b>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
<b>Chocolate Banana</b>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
<b>\hSilky
Banana Cream</b>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
<b>\hStrawberry
Almond Cream</b>

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.560
We can also try some crêpes—

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.280
I'm leaving.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.730
H-Hey, Urami!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.770
I mean it, what's with ya?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.810
The sister I looked up to is gone now.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:35.790
Urami?

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:41.930
You look like a total weakling now!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:49.290
W-Wait, Urami!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.260
Urami!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:07.290
<i>Found Urami the Loner!</i>

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.990
Nowhere to be, huh, emo girl?

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:15.740
Whoops! Couldn't see ya with that 
black cloud hangin' over ya!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:18.740
Shut up.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:21.370
What? You say somethin'?

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.250
Couldn't hear ya!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.780
She can't even talk back 
without her big sister around.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.590
Total emo!

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:35.940
Urami ain't left her room yet?

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:39.760
No, an' it's been a whole week.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:44.450
She must be so sad to have 
her sister away in Tokyo.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:56.620
<i>Reaper Princess appears before 
our Gelato 5 once more!</i>

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.800
We've been waitin' for ya, Desumi-sensei!

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.010
Hooray! Hooray!

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.910
Go, Big Sis!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.420
Darn it, five on one ain't fair!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:11.300
She needs backup! What're those 
oafish foot soldiers thinkin'?

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.650
You hear that, Urami?

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.300
We lost again today!

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.930
But your big sister stayed 
on her feet to the end!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.310
Urami! Your sister's 
workin' hard again today!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:27.310
Urami! Your sister's gotten 
even stronger than before!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:31.320
Urami! Your sister was the top 
performer again this month!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.410
Isn't that somethin', Urami?

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:37.570
Your sister's finally 
been promoted to monster!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.940
Urami...

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.720
I wanna be like my big sister.

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:06.770
<i>My big sister was the one thing 
that kept me goin' in life.</i>

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:12.440
<i>But she used to be so awesome... 
and now, she's changed.</i>

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:19.710
<i>She met that strange man here 
in the city, an' he ruined her.</i>

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.400
Hey, you cryin'?

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.300
Dumped by your man?

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:38.550
Come hang out with me and forget that jerk.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:41.950
Hang on, man. She seem a little young to you?

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.300
Who cares? She's a cutie.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.890
C'mon, let's go!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.100
Let me go.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.520
Hey, did she just mumble something?

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:54.270
What are you, some kind of emo kid?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.600
Yeah, looks totally emo to me!

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:01.910
Bet she can't even hold 
a proper conversation.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:03.800
Hello!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:04.450
Hello!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.420
You hear me?

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:09.020
<i>Nowhere to be, huh, emo girl?</i>

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:11.210
<i>Total emo!</i>

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:19.930
Who are you supposed to be?

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.030
Big Sister...

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:31.820
Don't cry, Urami.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.700
Here. Want a crêpe?

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.770
I think... we got bigger 
things to worry about...

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.990
Hey, it's fine.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:46.020
You said you think I look weak, didn't you?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.960
But I'm actually the strongest 
I've been in my life!

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:59.880
C'mon, don't ignore us. 
That's how you make us mad.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:03.350
We might look nice, but we're real bad guys.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:06.740
It seems I don't have to hold back, then.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.550
Better be careful.

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:13.240
I'm the real bad guy here.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.050
Fall in love, Urami.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.700
Love is what you need to survive.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.940
That ain't what you used to say.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.440
You'll understand, some day.

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:59.460
Yeah, right. 
I'd rather not understand that.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:07.720
The crêpe is good.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.690
<i>My big sister has changed.</i>

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:26.900
<i>She's lost her edge, become soft and girly.</i>

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:31.810
<i>But I guess she ain't so bad that way.</i>

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:33.960
<i>But you...</i>

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.640
<i>You're a big problem.</i>

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.480
<i>I'm never gonna like you.</i>

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:38.980
<b>Desumi-san</b>

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:38.980
Desumi-san!

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:43.550
<i>Once I join Gekko, 
you're the first one I'll purge.</i>

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.270
<i>Mwahaha...</i>

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.390
<i>Mwahaha...</i>

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:48.330
<i>Mwahahahaha!</i>

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:21.800
Big Sister!

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:23.070
Big Sister!

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:24.380
Big Sister!

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:25.810
Big Sister...

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:27.010
Big Sister...

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.050
Big Sister!

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:30.720
Urami! Where are you?

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:34.600
<i>Next episode: "Atop the Kokutei Moon."</i>

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 10   Atop the Kokutei Moon

00:23:34.820 --> 00:23:37.720
<i>Big Sister... I love you.</i>

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.350
Urami!
